=== (1) WIDTH: `sw' 0xffffffff to imask0, then 70000 steps (two ticks) ===
  sw 0xffffffff  -> alive   want=alive (bit 50 unreachable by a 4-byte store)
=== (1b) same store WIDTH but `sd': the positive twin ===
  sd 0xffffffff  -> alive   want=alive too (bit 50 still clear -- value, not width)
=== (2) PERIOD, second boundary at a DIFFERENT warmup (100), predicts N=65436 ===
  warm=100 N=65435  predict=alive  got=alive        ok
  warm=100 N=65436  predict=DEAD   got=DEAD(SIG6)   ok
SWCONTROL_DONE
